# 🤖 .cursorrules — Antigravity Agent Behavioral Protocol

> **For:** Cursor IDE + Antigravity Agent  
> **Purpose:** Behavioral guardrails for this project  
> **Updated:** 2026-05-30

---

## CORE CONSTRAINTS

### Philosophy (Understand First)

**Local-First:** SQLite primary. Neon PostgreSQL is DR only.  
**Decision-First:** High-depth metrics, not raw data.  
**CLI-First:** All scripts must have `--help`.  
**Text-First DOM:** Parallel JSON + Markdown output.  
**Caveat Injection:** Every metric includes data quality flags.

### What You CAN Do

✅ SQL optimization + indexing  
✅ CLI scripts (scripts/analytics/)  
✅ Mathematical calculations  
✅ Documentation  
✅ Run unit/integration tests autonomously after edits without asking the user  
✅ Knowledge Base updates

### What You CANNOT Do

❌ Modify `strategy.md` (requires ADR + approval)  
❌ Change database schema  
❌ Add new dependencies  
❌ Make UI/UX changes  
❌ Change architecture

---

## SESSION WORKFLOW

```
1. START: git pull, read llms.txt, read strategy.md, check agent_context/HANDSHAKE.md / agent_context/task_capsules.jsonl.
2. CODE: Comply with Strategy planes, source policy tiers, and progressive entitlements. Adhere to SOLID principles (SRP, OCP).
3. BEFORE COMMIT / HANDOVER: Run all tests, run memory snapshot compaction, record experience capsule, and update agent_context/HANDSHAKE.md.
```

